or:rgb(92,11,214);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><p style=\"margin-bottom:24px;outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(111,19,209);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS BRIEF</span></p></section></section></section></section><section id=\"yaodian\" style=\"margin:20px 10px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">01</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">蚂蚁灵波科技开源流式三维重建模型LingBot-Map，支持单RGB摄像头实时建图</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">02</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯混元开源视频生成加速方案DisCa，实现11.8倍提速并被CVPR2026收录</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">03</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">波士顿动力集成谷歌Gemini模型，升级机器狗Spot工业检测能力</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">NVIDIA推出全球首个开源量子AI模型NVIDIA Ising，提升量子纠错性能</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic开源MCP协议被曝严重设计缺陷，超20万台AI服务器面临远程代码执行风险</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁灵波科技开源流式三维重建模型LingBot-Map，支持单RGB摄像头实时建图</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/08c14f7fa24890320b883c90a7a5d0bb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">4月16日，蚂蚁灵波科技正式开源流式三维重建模型LingBot-Map。该模型仅需单个普通RGB摄像头，即可在视频采集过程中实时估计相机位姿并重建场景三维结构。LingBot-Map采用流式处理架构，打破了传统方法需预先采集完整序列的局限，实现了边接收画面边输出定位与结构的实时交互。性能方面，该模型在Oxford Spires数据集上的轨迹误差仅为此前最优流式方法的三分之一，支持约20FPS的实时推理，并在超万帧长视频运行中保持精度稳定。此次开源补齐了蚂蚁灵波在具身智能领域实时空间理解的核心能力，降低了高精度三维感知的硬件门槛，将加速机器人导航、自动驾驶及AR硬件在复杂动态环境中的感知与决策进化。开发者现可通过Hugging Face及ModelScope获取相关资源。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯混元开源视频生成加速方案DisCa，实现11.8倍提速并被CVPR2026收录</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/af1dae73cfc34864d932d7a2c76c32c3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯混元团队正式开源视频生成加速方案DisCa，该方案代码与模型权重已公开，并被CVPR2026收录。DisCa针对已蒸馏的少步模型进行优化，通过引入轻量级神经网络预测器，利用对抗学习训练预测特征演化轨迹，在保证生成质量的前提下，将推理速度提升至11.8倍，解决了少步模型直接使用特征缓存导致的误差崩坏问题。此外，团队针对视频生成任务改进了R-MeanFlow方案，通过将步长范围约束在合理区间，避免了激进的一步生成对训练产生的负面影响。该研究成果已应用于HunyuanVideo-1.5模型的实际训练中。DisCa不仅是学术创新，更在工程落地层面提供了可复现的路径，为大规模部署视频生成能力的团队提供了有效的技术参考，显著降低了AIGC领域的推理成本与技术门槛。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">波士顿动力集成谷歌Gemini模型，升级机器狗Spot工业检测能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6c291c0e954e49b085d2530517daa36f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">波士顿动力宣布旗下机器狗Spot已集成谷歌DeepMind开发的Gemini Robotics-ER1.6模型，旨在显著提升其在工业环境中的自主决策与检测能力。此次技术升级使Spot能够更精准地识别潜在爆炸风险、定位危险碎片及泄漏物，并具备自主读取复杂仪表和视镜数据的能力。在执行任务时，Spot可智能调用视觉-语言-动作模型等AI工具，从单纯的路径跟随者进化为具备深度环境理解力的协作机器人。该合作标志着机器人技术与大模型的深度融合，通过提升工业设施安全监测的智能化水平，为复杂场景下的自动化巡检提供了更高效的解决方案。波士顿动力已通过演示视频展示了Spot在模拟工业环境中的自主处理能力，进一步验证了该技术在工业自动化领域的应用价值。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">NVIDIA推出全球首个开源量子AI模型NVIDIA Ising，提升量子纠错性能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3371edac10193960308e8a3aac430def.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">NVIDIA正式发布全球首个开源量子AI模型“NVIDIA Ising”，旨在攻克量子处理器校准与量子纠错两大核心难题。该模型系列包含Ising Calibration与Ising Decoding两部分：其中，Ising Calibration为350亿参数的视觉语言模型，可将量子处理器测量数据的校准时间从数天缩短至数小时；Ising Decoding则由两款针对速度与准确性优化的3D卷积神经网络组成，在实时解码任务中，其速度较行业基准pyMatching提升2.5倍，准确率提升3倍，且训练数据需求仅为后者的十分之一。目前，该模型已获IonQ、哈佛大学及费米国家加速器实验室等机构采用，为构建混合量子-经典计算系统提供关键支持。NVIDIA Ising的推出进一步完善了其开放模型体系，通过将AI与量子计算深度融</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic开源MCP协议被曝严重设计缺陷，超20万台AI服务器面临远程代码执行风险</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/7e3fe178970c172a244da01023911208.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">网络安全公司OX Security于4月15日发布报告，指出Anthropic推出的开源标准MCP（模型上下文协议）存在架构级设计缺陷，导致超过20万台AI服务器暴露在远程代码执行风险中。漏洞根源在于MCP SDK的STDIO接口，该接口在启动本地服务器进程时，会对传入的操作系统命令缺乏校验，即便启动失败也会执行。此缺陷波及Python、TypeScript、Java、Go、Rust等11种官方支持语言。研究发现，LangFlow、Letta AI、Flowise及Windsurf IDE等平台均受影响，其中Windsurf IDE漏洞已获CVE编号。Anthropic在1月收到通报后仅更新安全文档提示谨慎使用，未进行架构修复。目前LiteLLM、DocsGPT等平台已发布补丁，但协议层根本问题仍未解决，且主流</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
